<title>MOLDOVA: MOLDOVA INFLATION FALLS TO 0.6 PCT IN MAY.</title>
<headline>MOLDOVA INFLATION FALLS TO 0.6 PCT IN MAY.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rise in Moldovan consumer</p>
<p>prices fell to 0.6 percent in May from 0.8 percent in April, the</p>
<p>State Statistics Department said on Monday.</p>
<p>    MOLDOVAN CONSUMER PRICES   May 97 April97 May 96</p>
<p>    Monthly pct change	   +0.6    +0.8     +0.8</p>
<p>    Year-on-year pct change   +12.0   +12.0    +26.0</p>
<p>The National Bank expects annual inflation to slow this year</p>
<p>to 10 percent from 15.1 percent in 1996.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
